@startuml pipeline-sequence
title Basic Pipeline - Sequence
skinparam shadowing false
actor Developer
participant Git
participant Jenkins
participant Trivy
participant "./website\n(shared mount)" as Web
participant Nginx
actor Browser

Developer -> Git : push commit
Jenkins -> Git : checkout scm
Jenkins -> Trivy : trivy fs website/
Trivy --> Jenkins : HIGH/CRITICAL report
Jenkins -> Web : rm old files, cp new files
Web --> Nginx : visible at /var/www/html
Browser -> Nginx : GET http://localhost:8081
Nginx --> Browser : updated index.html
@enduml
